    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943800/extras/5492900b207380a17fb1507ce17b4e06.poster.avif?t=1718782068\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943800/extras/5492900b207380a17fb1507ce17b4e06.webm?t=1718782068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943800/extras/5492900b207380a17fb1507ce17b4e06.mp4?t=1718782068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual Trucking is a laid-back delivery simulator without any time pressure.</h2><br>It's a small game, a sort of experiment with 3d and chill gameplay. Something that you can play while listening to your favorite podcast.<br><br>- Choose a delivery mission, head to the location and pick up the truck and cargo<br>- Buy different trucks for specific delivery missions<br>- Purchase real estate and gain passive income",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943800/extras/5492900b207380a17fb1507ce17b4e06.poster.avif?t=1718782068\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943800/extras/5492900b207380a17fb1507ce17b4e06.webm?t=1718782068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2943800/extras/5492900b207380a17fb1507ce17b4e06.mp4?t=1718782068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Casual Trucking is a laid-back delivery simulator without any time pressure.</h2><br>It's a small game, a sort of experiment with 3d and chill gameplay. Something that you can play while listening to your favorite podcast.<br><br>- Choose a delivery mission, head to the location and pick up the truck and cargo<br>- Buy different trucks for specific delivery missions<br>- Purchase real estate and gain passive income",
